## Torus - inductance extraction test model
## Run: playback "S:/Radia/01_GitHub/examples/cubit/inductance_torus.jou"
##
## STEP reimport is included (required for OCC seam fix + BEM)

reset

## Parameters
#{R = 0.1}
#{a = 0.01}

## Create torus + STEP reimport (ACIS -> OCC seam fix)
create torus major radius {R} minor radius {a}
export step "temp_torus.step" overwrite
reset
import step "temp_torus.step" heal

## Volume mesh
volume all scheme tetmesh
curve all interval 6
mesh volume all

## Blocks
block 1 add volume all
block 2 add tri all
block 2 name "conductor"

## Save
save cub5 "S:/Radia/01_GitHub/examples/cubit/inductance_torus.cub5" overwrite
